@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> R1 : [create new account]
state R1 <<choice>>
R1 --> R2 : [validate registration]
R2 --> L1 : [log in upon successful registration]
L1 --> T1 : [check ticket status]
T1 --> B1 : [book a ticket]
B1 --> P1 : [make the payment]
P1 --> M1 : [manage account details]
M1 --> L2 : [logout after any action]
L2 --> [*] : [log out]

@enduml
